'''Chalkanoras Idaliou''' ({{langx|el|Χαλκάνορας Ιδαλίου}}) is a [[Cyprus|Cypriot]] football team currently playing in the Cypriot Second Division. The team was established in 1948 and is based in the village of [[Dali, Cyprus|Dali]] in [[Nicosia District|Nicosia]] district.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.politis-sports.com/cgibin/hweb?-A=3023&-V=teams|publisher=Politis Sports|script-title=el:Χαλκάνορας Ιδαλίου|language=Greek|access-date=3 January 2009|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20080526063014/http://www.politis-sports.com/cgibin/hweb?-A=3023&-V=teams|archive-date=26 May 2008|url-status=dead}}</ref> The club has played two seasons in the [[Cypriot First Division|first division]]; in [[Cypriot First Division 1976–77|1976–77]] and [[Cypriot First Division 1977–78|1977–78]]."}}
